    <string name="broop_overview_hr_method_title">How sleep heart-rate readings work</string>
    <string name="broop_overview_hr_method">Pre-sleep HR compares the 30 minutes before sleep with prior nights; it needs 10 samples and a personal baseline. Enable it in Settings → Sleep. Sleep dip compares full five-minute epochs in primary sleep (including in-bed wake) with the preceding waking interval, excluding naps. Each side needs 30 observed epochs; missing epochs stay missing. Coverage means observed epochs. These trends do not change scores, diagnose illness or explain causes. No card appears without usable data.</string>
